WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.183
Browse the feed. Text posts, photos, and videos appear together.

00:00:09.183 --> 00:00:14.622
Open a post. Every post has a page of its own, with a link to share.

00:00:14.622 --> 00:00:23.954
Write a post. Type a caption, add photos, and see a preview as you write.

00:00:23.954 --> 00:00:27.016
Publish and share. The published post has a URL you can share.

00:00:27.016 --> 00:00:31.232
See the new post. New posts appear at the top of your website’s feed.

00:00:31.232 --> 00:00:37.169
Light or dark. Readers can switch themes, or follow their system’s setting.
